{"unit_id":"ItQianChen__dsh-github-flow#card-zh","repo":"ItQianChen/dsh-github-flow","commit":"eba6c30fc3f272a7427b76aaf6f879780212fa7d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH GitHub Flow（DSH 插件，Web、CLI 与 TUI）：通过 GitHub CLI 为 DSH 提供 GitHub 协作工具和 Web 工作台。它注册 GitHub 服务及 Agent 工具，覆盖 PR、Issue、Actions、仓库、Release、标签、Skills、讨论和 Projects；Web 面板展示仓库概览与协作状态，并提供 /gh 快捷命令。用户可审阅 PR、诊断 CI、读取仓库文件和准备发布。适合在 DSH 中维护 GitHub 项目、跟进评审与构建的开发者。需要安装并登录 GitHub CLI；Web 面板需要 DSH webServer 服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/main.ts:150-193","src/tools/task.ts:71-154","src/client.ts:1-34"]}
